{"id":"operacio_n","lemma":"operación","pos":"noun","rank":943,"glosses":["operation (a surgical procedure)","operation (the method or practice by which actions are done)","operation (a procedure for generating a value from one or more other values)"],"ipa":"/opeɾaˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"operaciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/14/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-operaci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Necesito una operación?","en":"Do I need an operation?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38648","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"La operación fue un éxito.","en":"The surgery was a success.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/607982","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"success"}]},{"text":"¿El paciente está preparado para la operación?","en":"Is the patient prepared for surgery?","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"patient"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"prepared"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"¿Deseas hacer cualquier otra operación?","en":"Do you wish to make any other transaction?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704447","words":[{"g":"to wish","l":"desear"},{"g":"to do"},null,{"g":"someone else","l":"otro"},null]},{"text":"La operación tenía que mantenerse en secreto.","en":"The operation had to be kept secret.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705430","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to keep","l":"mantener"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"in secret, secretly"]]}]}